                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The Kaimahi Payslip FTE/Hours report has been developed so that you can easily  track how many FTE and hours are recorded in Datapay for the Kaimahi in your Region. To improve accuracy of the report sleepover hours have been removed from the hours. Annual leave, sick leave and other leave types are included in the report.  The filters for this report are available on the left hand side of the home page as well as on any other page within the report from the pop out hamburger menu (3 lines) on the top right."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The data is refreshed every fortnight on the day after pay cycle end date. You can access the report fro"
                  },
